martinthomson, richsalz)
    https://github.com/tlswg/tls13-spec/issues/1214=20
  - #1212 general alert (7 by davidben, richsalz, tomato42)
    https://github.com/tlswg/tls13-spec/issues/1212=20
  - #1209 "client authentication" -> "certificate-based client authenticati=
on" (1 by ekr)
    https://github.com/tlswg/tls13-spec/issues/1209=20
  - #1208 Contradition around user_cancelled (3 by davidben, ekr)
    https://github.com/tlswg/tls13-spec/issues/1208=20

  4 issues closed:
  - "client authentication" -> "certificate-based client authentication" ht=
tps://github.com/tlswg/tls13-spec/issues/1209=20
  - Even shorter secret names? https://github.com/tlswg/tls13-spec/issues/1=
200=20
