    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls-conn-id/issues/80=20



Pull requests
-------------
* tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni (+4/-2/=F0=9F=92=AC2)
  4 pull requests submitted:
  - Add note about denial-of-service vulnerability (by cjpatton)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/385=20
  - Clarify privacy risk pertaining to resumption. (by cbartle891)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/383=20
  - Clarify "don't stick out" considerations (by cjpatton)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/382=20
  - Truncate the config_id to a single byte. (by chris-wood)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/381=20

  2 pull requests received 2 new comments:
  - #385 Add note about denial-of-service vulnerability (1 by cjpatton)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/385=20
  - #313 Replace record-level padding with handshake-level padding (1 by cj=
patton)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/313=20

  2 pull requests merged:
  - Clarify privacy risk pertaining to resumption.
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/383=20
  - Move to a key identity in lieu of the config identifier hash.
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/376=20

* tlswg/tls13-spec (+2/-6/=F0=9F=92=AC1)
  2 pull requests submitted:
  - minor editorial spelling (by emanjon)
    https://github.com/tlswg/tls13-spec/pull/1215=20
  - Changelog for -01 (by ekr)
    https://github.com/tlswg/tls13-spec/pull/1213=20

  1 pull requests received 1 new comments:
  - #1215 minor editorial spelling (1 by ekr)
    https://github.com/tlswg/tls13-spec/pull/1215=20

  6 pull requests merged:
  - Changelog for -01
    https://github.com/tlswg/tls13-spec/pull/1213=20
  - Shorten some unnecessarily long names.
    https://github.com/tlswg/tls13-spec/pull/1202=20
  - Align TLS 1.2 terminology with this document
    https://github.com/tlswg/tls13-spec/pull/1204=20
  - Security Property - Protection of endpoint identities
    https://github.com/tlswg/tls13-spec/pull/1210=20
  - Discuss tracking implications of session resumption.
    https://github.com/tlswg/tls13-spec/pull/1205=20
  - Editorial: "Client Authentication" -> "Certificate-Based Client Authent=
ication"
    https://github.com/tlswg/tls13-spec/pull/1211=20

* tlswg/dtls-conn-id (+0/-0/=F0=9F=92=AC2)
  2 pull requests received 2 new comments:
  - #86 Add Achim Kraus to authors. (1 by jsalowey)
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls-conn-id/pull/86=20
  - #81 Corrected statement about multi-homing and CID changes (1 by jsalow=
ey)
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls-conn-id/pull/81=20

* tlswg/external-psk-design-team (+1/-1/=F0=9F=92=AC3)
  1 pull requests submitted:
